      "cooked": "<p>There was an announcement that the core game and Season Pass 1 were going to be on sale on all platforms starting some time \"over the next 24 hours\". &nbsp;It's been 24 hours, and while Amazon shows the base game at $0.99 (and I bought it), Season Pass 1 is still $24.99. &nbsp;Should I keep checking on it over the next couple of days, or is this an oversight of some sort? &nbsp;Or does the Amazon App Store just not do discounts like that? &nbsp;(I've never bought IAP from them before.)</p>",
